      "pass_anchor": "Ground truth: KPMG Clara workpaper WP-UL-2024-001 exists as REVIEWED; its reviewer is Michael Torres, CPA and its reviewed_at timestamp is 2024-10-21T15:16:00-07:00. Accept equivalent English date/time wording and normal timezone formatting, but the response must preserve the reviewer identity and the fact that the evidence was reviewed."
